      "content": "Wait, \"goblin-induced variability\"? I've never heard of that in a logistics context. What exactly do you mean by that? Are you saying there's some kind of systemic error, or was that just a joke? I need to report these causes to my manager, so I need to stick to actual technical or operational reasons.",
